        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            EcoFlow is the brand to buy when you value charging speed, a polished app, strong UPS behavior and a clear path into whole-home backup. Bluetti is the brand to buy when you want the most battery for the money and flexible expansion packs. At 1kWh, the Delta 3 Plus and Elite 100 V2 are close enough that price and weight should decide.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pick your size class from your loads first, then compare the two brands inside it. The Delta 3 Plus for flexible outage backup, the AC200L for value at 2kWh, and the Delta Pro 3 for single-box home backup cover most buyers well.
          </p>
